PIN CONNECTIONS 

🔌 Single ESP32 — Final Pin Connections
1. Float Switches
Tank	Float Switch Wire 1	Float Switch Wire 2
Salt Water Tank	ESP32 GPIO32	GND
Good Water Tank	ESP32 GPIO33	GND

No external resistors are required because the code uses INPUT_PULLUP.

Salt Float:
GPIO32 ───── Float Switch ───── GND


Good Float:
GPIO33 ───── Float Switch ───── GND
2. 2-Channel Relay Module
Relay Module	ESP32
IN1	GPIO27
IN2	GPIO26
VCC	5V / VIN
GND	GND
ESP32                  Relay Module
────────────────────────────────────
GPIO27 ─────────────── IN1 → Salt Motor
GPIO26 ─────────────── IN2 → Good Motor
5V/VIN ─────────────── VCC
GND ────────────────── GND
