4. Complete ESP32 Pin Summary
ESP32 GPIO	Connection
GPIO26	Good Water Motor Relay IN2
GPIO27	Salt Water Motor Relay IN1
GPIO32	Salt Water Tank Float
GPIO33	Good Water Tank Float
GND	Float switches + Relay GND
5V/VIN	Relay VCC

No SX1278/LoRa is required. No transmitter or receiver. Only one ESP32.

⚠️ The motor side is 230 V AC. Do not connect mains directly to the ESP32; the relay provides the switching interface. Have the mains wiring done or checked by a qualified electrician.
